1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"The work between the work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"August 5, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"3 minutes"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Some of the most useful work I do leaves almost nothing behind.",{"children":["Some of the most useful work I do leaves almost nothing behind."]}],["$","p","1-It happens in the question that changes the brief, the conversation before the meeting, or the note that explains why a decision was made.",{"children":["It happens in the question that changes the brief, the conversation before the meeting, or the note that explains why a decision was made."]}],["$","p","2-I think of this as the work between the work. A portfolio makes design look fairly orderly. Here is a report design. Here is an identity, a platform, or a system. Each one appears to be a self-contained object.",{"children":["I think of this as the work between the work. A portfolio makes design look fairly orderly. Here is a report design. Here is an identity, a platform, or a system. Each one appears to be a self-contained object."]}],["$","p","3-The actual project is messier. It includes people, budgets, old decisions, new anxieties, unclear language, and deadlines that do not care whether the idea is ready.",{"children":["The actual project is messier. It includes people, budgets, old decisions, new anxieties, unclear language, and deadlines that do not care whether the idea is ready."]}],["$","p","4-For a long time, I treated all of this as the part surrounding the design. The real work was the thing I could see.",{"children":["For a long time, I treated all of this as the part surrounding the design. The real work was the thing I could see."]}],["$","p","5-A good idea can fail because it was introduced at the wrong moment, separated from its reason, or handed to someone without enough context to continue it. An ordinary idea can improve because someone asked the right question early enough.",{"children":["A good idea can fail because it was introduced at the wrong moment, separated from its reason, or handed to someone without enough context to continue it. An ordinary idea can improve because someone asked the right question early enough."]}],["$","p","6-A lot of this work is translation.",{"children":["A lot of this work is translation."]}],["$","p","7-Someone asks for more impact. They may mean contrast, confidence, or a clearer sense of what matters first. They may simply be worried that no one will pay attention.",{"children":["Someone asks for more impact. They may mean contrast, confidence, or a clearer sense of what matters first. They may simply be worried that no one will pay attention."]}],["$","p","8-The request is rarely the whole request. I try to listen for the concern underneath the words. Naming it can save a surprising amount of time. More importantly, it can keep everyone from carefully an solving the wrong problem in excruciating detail.",{"children":["The request is rarely the whole request. I try to listen for the concern underneath the words. Naming it can save a surprising amount of time. More importantly, it can keep everyone from carefully an solving the wrong problem in excruciating detail."]}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10"],null]}],"$L11"]}]]}]}]
b:["$","p","9-Sequence matters too. Rough work shown as finished will be judged badly. Finished work presented as an open question can be pulled apart for no useful reason.",{"children":["Sequence matters too. Rough work shown as finished will be judged badly. Finished work presented as an open question can be pulled apart for no useful reason."]}]
c:["$","p","10-After an important conversation, I try to write down what was decided, why it was decided, and what remains open.",{"children":["After an important conversation, I try to write down what was decided, why it was decided, and what remains open."]}]
d:["$","p","11-This became more frequent as I started leading projects. At the end of some days, I had made very little myself. I had clarified a decision, connected two people, protected time for an idea, or removed an obstacle.",{"children":["This became more frequent as I started leading projects. At the end of some days, I had made very little myself. I had clarified a decision, connected two people, protected time for an idea, or removed an obstacle."]}]
e:["$","p","12-At first this felt suspiciously unlike work. It is not automatically valuable, but now I see it as an essential part of making the conditions for good work.",{"children":["At first this felt suspiciously unlike work. It is not automatically valuable, but now I see it as an essential part of making the conditions for good work."]}]
f:["$","p","13-My test is fairly simple: did this make the problem clearer, prepare a real decision, protect the idea, or make the next step easier for someone else? If not, it was probably just calories burned.",{"children":["My test is fairly simple: did this make the problem clearer, prepare a real decision, protect the idea, or make the next step easier for someone else? If not, it was probably just calories burned."]}]
10:["$","p","14-The work between the work is difficult to see. But it is there, in the corner of my eye: fewer surprises, calmer handoffs, and decisions that continue to make sense after the meeting is over.",{"children":["The work between the work is difficult to see. But it is there, in the corner of my eye: fewer surprises, calmer handoffs, and decisions that continue to make sense after the meeting is over."]}]
